    value: ' '
  - key: STATUSMATCH_DETAIL_POPUP_CELL_HEADER_TITLE_TEXT
    value: <align=left><size=30>What is Status Match?
  - key: STATUSMATCH_DETAIL_POPUP_CELL_HEADER_CONTENT_TEXT
    value: <align=left><size=20>Status Match provides upgraded tiers to those who
      are VIP players in other slot games. We provide a Club Vegas tier that has
      similar requirements to that of your other VIP status. We do not, however,
      guarantee that the matched status will provide identical benefits.
  - key: STATUSMATCH_DETAIL_POPUP_CELL_COMMENT_TEXT
    value: <size=20>*If you don't see your VIP program here, you will be matched
      accordingly.
  - key: STATUSMATCH_DETAIL_POPUP_CELL_CLUBVEGAS_TEXT
