  - key: POPUP_DELETE_ACCOUNT_INFO_INFO
    value: "<color=#FF0200>Attention : \n<color=#ffffff>Only Accounts that have been
      registered for\nmore than 14 days can be deleted.\n\n<color=#FF0200>Warning
      : \n<color=#ffffff>Your account will be locked for 30 days.\n\nAfter this,
      all data (including coins, game data, progress, and purchases)\nwill be permanently
      deleted and cannot be recovered.\n\nDuring the 30-day lock period should you
      log into your account again the\ndeletion process will be canceled."
