  - key: POPUP_DELETE_ACCOUNT_CONFIRM_INFO
    value: "Your account will be locked for 30 dyas - after which all of your\r\r\naccount
      and game data will be\r\ndeleted permanently and unrecoverable.\r\r\n\r\nDuring
      this 30 - day locked period, logging into your account will\r\r\nautomatically
